  preparing --> confirmed: kitchen, undo
  preparing --> ready: kitchen
  ready --> preparing: kitchen, not ready yet
  ready --> served: reception
  confirmed --> cancelled: reception, stock goes back
  preparing --> cancelled: reception
  ready --> cancelled: reception
  served --> [*]
